  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways to Prosperity - Danish Refugee Council</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of the project is that vulnerable and marginalized refugees and host communities in Turkana County are able to access and benefit from skills and resources, greater market growth and integration, and an improved enabling environment leading to greater self-reliance and resilience.

The implementing partner is Danish Refugee Council in collaboration with DanChurch Aid and  a local Kenyan organization-TUPADO.</narrative>
  </description>
